<title>USA: Harcourt General raising dividend.</title>
<headline>Harcourt General raising dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harcourt General Inc said Tuesday its board of directors voted to increase the quarterly cash dividend on its common stock to $0.18 per share from $0.17 per share.</p>
<p>The company's board also voted to increase the quarterly cash dividend on its Series A stock to $0.21 per share from $0.19 per share. The quarterly cash divided on its Class B stock is to increase to $0.16 per share from $0.15 per share, it said.</p>
<p>The cash dividends are payable October 31, record October 14.</p>
